     "note": "Chapters: 1:11 when to use it · 1:50 situations (request, instruction, order) · 3:00 the formal imperative · 4:05 examples · 5:04 the exception *Seien Sie …!*"
    },
    {
     "type": "note",
     "title": "Sie-imperative: swap the order",
     "md": "Use the imperative to ask, instruct or order. For people you say *Sie* to:\n\nTake the **Sie-form** and put the **verb first**:\n\n{de:Sie trinken den Tee.} → {de:**Trinken Sie** den Tee!}\n\nThe only exception: *sein* → {de:**Seien Sie** vorsichtig!}\n\nAdd **bitte** to make it polite: {de:Kommen Sie bitte herein!}"
    },
